# 仓库内文本统一使用 LF，避免 Windows 上 core.autocrlf 产生 CRLF 警告和整文件 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理在 CRLF 下解析最稳定。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
